@startuml
title Plan activity overlap row allocation
' Traces: OMCT-C12-L2-01.03
participant "Plan View" as View
participant "Activity Layout" as Layout
participant "Row Allocator" as Allocator
participant "Activity Swimlane Renderer" as Renderer

View -> Layout: calculateActivityExtents(activities)
activate Layout
Layout --> View: time and label extents
deactivate Layout
View -> Allocator: allocateRows(extents)
activate Allocator
loop activities in group
    Allocator -> Allocator: assignNonoverlappingRow(activity)
end
Allocator --> View: row assignments
deactivate Allocator
View -> Renderer: renderRows(rowAssignments)
activate Renderer
Renderer --> View: nonoverlapping rows rendered
deactivate Renderer
@enduml
